# Snaremaster Sprite: "When this creature enters, you may pay {2}. When you do, tap target creature an opponent controls and put a stun
# counter on it" (CR 603.12). The first Sprite, with the payment declined, does nothing: Bot2's Ornithopter stays untapped and no
# target is asked. The second, with {2} paid, asks for a target; only an opponent's creature is offered (Bot1's own Ornithopter is
# refused), and it is tapped and stunned.

[Bot1 Deck]
Snaremaster Sprite
Snaremaster Sprite
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Snaremaster Sprite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Decline
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#1.Tapped = false
? Bot2.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2.Tapped = false
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Snaremaster Sprite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
